// Kotlin language package. Declarations here are visible at every output target
// that selects --lang kotlin.
//
// The build node carries no props; see the note in
// codegen/lang/javascript/doc.sngl. The Android build knobs — the
// application id, the launcher icon, whether to emit a Gradle project — belong
// to the platform rather than to the language, and are declared in
// codegen/platform/android/android.sngl. What would belong here is something
// true of Kotlin at every platform, which so far is nothing.
